			(uuid "1f07af0b-9b2b-4a7f-a30e-18b2f043dacd")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
					(thickness 0.15)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "RT9080-18GJ5 Low-Dropout Linear Regulator\n\nThe RT9080 is a low-dropout (LDO) voltage regulators with enable function that operates from 1.2V to 5.5V. It provides up to 600mA of output current and offers low-power operation in miniaturized packaging.\n\nThe features of low quiescent current as low as 2μA and almost zero disable current is ideal for powering the battery equipment to a longer service life. The RT9080 is stable with the ceramic output capacitor over its wide input range from 1.2V to 5.5V and the entire range of output load current (0mA to 600mA). The output for this LDO is 1.8V."
			(at 0 0 0)
